# Web UI

- Follow skill `crystal-frontend-ui` (reads `frontend-design` + `web-design-guidelines` + `hallmark`) **inside Streamlit limits**.
- Hide default Streamlit chrome. Tokens in CSS, not inline hex in widgets.
- Three worlds stay three columns (desktop) or three tabs (mobile) — never one merged feed.
- Mobile-first: 375px must hold. No two-line primary controls.
- Do not ship Next.js, Relomap stack, or invented metrics.
- Do not commit `node_modules/`.
- Before done: open the app in the browser and click a card plus the archive toggle.
